###############################
# Dataset metadata that cannot be derived from other sources (e.g. the NDE Dataset Register).
# Typically used when the dataset URI used in the data (la:member_of) differs from the
# dataset URI used in the NDE Dataset Register catalog entry.
###############################

@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .

# The NDE Dataset Register catalog entry for the RCE colonial objects dataset uses a
# different URI than the one RCE uses as the graph name (and that objects reference via
# la:member_of). Link the data graph URI to the publisher so the object detail page can
# look up the correct organization.
<https://linkeddata.cultureelerfgoed.nl/rce/colonialobjects>
  schema:publisher <https://linkeddata.cultureelerfgoed.nl/rce> .
